---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About GearCompared"
  description="GearCompared is an independent product review site helping you choose the best standing desks and kitchen appliances through honest, hands-on testing."
>
  <main class="content">
    <article>
      <header class="article-header">
        <h1>About GearCompared</h1>
        <p class="article-desc">
          We help you cut through the noise and pick the right gear for your home office and kitchen.
        </p>
      </header>

      <section class="guide-section">
        <h2>Who We Are</h2>
        <p>
          GearCompared is an independent product review and comparison site run by a small team of product testers and writers. We're not a big media company — we're people who genuinely care about finding the best gear and sharing what we learn.
        </p>
        <p>
          Our editorial team tests every product we recommend. We buy products at retail price, use them for weeks, and write honest reviews based on real experience — not spec sheet summaries.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="guide-section">
        <h2>What We Cover</h2>
        <p>
          We focus on two categories where the differences between products really matter:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Standing desks</strong> — electric, manual, converters, and gaming desks for home offices</li>
          <li><strong>Kitchen appliances</strong> — blenders, air fryers, coffee makers, stand mixers, and toasters</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          We don't try to cover everything. We go deep on a few categories so our reviews are genuinely useful.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="guide-section">
        <h2>Why Trust Us</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>We buy the products we review — no free samples</li>
          <li>Every review is based on hands-on use, not manufacturer claims</li>
          <li>We update reviews regularly with fresh pricing and rating data</li>
          <li>Our methodology is transparent (<a href="/methodology/">read it here</a>)</li>
          <li>We're clear about how we make money (<a href="/disclosure/">read our disclosure</a>)</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
    </article>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
